POST http://localhost:3000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ana Silva",
    "number": 12345
}

###

GET http://localhost:3000/students

###

GET http://localhost:3000/students?limit=1

###

GET http://localhost:3000/students/1

###

GET http://localhost:3000/students/99

###

POST http://localhost:3000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ana Silva"
}

### Atualizar o aluno 1
PUT http://localhost:3000/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Silva Santos",
  "number": 12345
}

### Atualizar com dados inválidos (deve dar 400)
PUT http://localhost:3000/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "number": 12345
}

### Atualizar aluno que não existe (deve dar 404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/students/99
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ninguém",
  "number": 1
}

### Apagar o aluno 2 (deve dar 204)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/students/2

### Apagar outra vez o aluno 2 (deve dar 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/students/2